@startuml
title RF49 — Teto salarial rígido e contratos · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "AuditService" as AuditService
control "CapEngine" as CapEngine
queue "EventBus" as EventBus
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Cassandra 4.1" as Cassandra
participant "Agendador/Job assíncrono" as Scheduler
actor "Jogador (IA)" as JogadorIA
Manager -> Frontend: abre Contratos e teto
Frontend -> API: GET /careers/{id}/cap
API -> UseCase: GetCapSheetUseCase
UseCase -> MySQL: owner · SalaryCapLedger (4 temporadas) · contratos
API --> Frontend: 200 CapSheetDto
Manager -> Frontend: propõe extensão ao QB (4 anos, bônus)
Frontend -> API: POST /players/{pid}/contract/negotiate
API -> UseCase: NegotiateContractUseCase «@Transactional»
UseCase -> CapEngine: validate(contrato, ledger, regras): janela, forma, teto
alt janela fechada / contrato inválido / acima do teto
  CapEngine --> UseCase: violação
  API --> Frontend: 422 com código e quanto falta
else senão
  UseCase -> JogadorIA: ContractValuation.evaluate(proposta, mercado da posição, moral, idade)
  JogadorIA --> UseCase: ACCEPT | COUNTER | REJECT
  alt ACCEPT
    UseCase -> CapEngine: capHitByYear(novo contrato) · ledger recalculado
    UseCase -> MySQL: UPDATE player.contract · ledger (version + 1)
    UseCase -> AuditService: CONTRACT_EXTENDED
    API --> Frontend: 200 contrato + ledger
  else senão
    UseCase -> MySQL: moral −3 se REJECT
    API --> Frontend: 200 COUNTER | REJECT
  end
end
Manager -> Frontend: simula corte do WR
Frontend -> API: GET /players/{pid}/release/preview
API -> CapEngine: deadMoney(contrato, hoje, pós-1º de junho)
API --> Frontend: preview (dead money, economia, hash)
Frontend -> API: POST /players/{pid}/release {previewHash, postJune1, expectedLedgerVersion}
alt versão divergente
  API --> Frontend: 409 CAP_LEDGER_CONFLICT
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: TX: Player WAIVED · ledger.deadMoney · WaiverClaim aberto
  UseCase -> EventBus: PlayerReleased
  EventBus -> Cassandra: notícia + inbox
  API --> Frontend: 200
end
Scheduler -> CapEngine: seasonRollover(club): piso, rollover, vencidos
CapEngine -> MySQL: SalaryCapLedger n+1
@enduml
